WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.751
This is the final completion page for Module 4 The
page tracks

00:00:05.777 --> 00:00:11.280
ten knowledge checks and six coding exercises Review
the counters before selecting

00:00:11.306 --> 00:00:17.074
Complete Module If something is incomplete the page
lists the missing

00:00:17.087 --> 00:00:22.117
activity and lets you return to the relevant slide
When you select

00:00:22.143 --> 00:00:26.670
Complete Module the browser creates an Assignment 4
submission summary containing your

00:00:26.696 --> 00:00:31.578
completion status knowledge-check answers and the
SQL saved for each coding exercise

00:00:33.311 --> 00:00:37.945
Review that report before copying it to Canvas If
the module is

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:42.142
incomplete you will be asked to confirm before
copying the current progress

00:00:43.898 --> 00:00:48.095
Your progress is stored locally in this browser so
changing devices using

00:00:48.121 --> 00:00:52.016
a private window or clearing browser storage may
remove the saved state
